2337 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2170 0 R
/E (Donald Miller's StoryBrand framework, published in 2017, is built on a single insight: customers don't care about your story, they care about their story, and whether you have a role in it. The SB7 structure positions the customer as the Hero, gives them a Guide \(your brand\), names the Problem \(external, internal, and philosophical\), provides a Plan, issues a Call to Action, describes Success, and shows what's at stake in Failure. When your marketing follows this structure, confused prospects become engaged ones.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
