>>
endobj
2413 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2172 0 R
/E (In a feed of infinite content, the first line of any post, email, or video is the only thing that decides whether the rest gets seen. A hook works by triggering one of four responses: Curiosity \(I need to know how this ends\), Relatability \(that is exactly my situation\), Controversy \(I disagree and want to respond\), or Value \(this will help me right now\). The 3H Hook System structures every piece of content around a strong opening that earns the scroll  followed by a clear value delivery and a closing that creates engagement or action.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
