2486 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2174 0 R
/E (E. Jerome McCarthy's 4Ps Marketing Mix - Product, Price, Place, Promotion  is the classic framework for building a complete marketing strategy. Booms and Bitner extended it to 7Ps for service businesses by adding People, Process, and Physical Evidence. The power of the framework is in checking coherence: if your premium pricing \(Price\) is contradicted by your distribution through discount channels \(Place\), your strategy has a gap. Every element of your marketing must reinforce the same positioning.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
