2613 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2178 0 R
/E (A Go-To-Market \(GTM\) Canvas is a structured plan that maps seven elements of a successful launch: Target Segment \(who exactly\), Value Proposition \(why this, why now\), Channels \(how you reach them\), Pricing \(how you charge\), Sales Motion \(how you convert\), Success Metrics \(how you know it's working\), and Launch Timeline \(sequenced actions\). Without a GTM Canvas, launches become activity without direction, lots of effort, unclear results.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
