2678 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2180 0 R
/E (Jeff Walker's Product Launch Formula, distilled for founders and operators, is a pre-launch sequence that builds anticipation through a structured four-phase approach: Seed \(plant the idea and gauge interest\), Pre-Launch Content \(deliver value that creates desire\), Launch \(open with urgency and social proof\), Post-Launch \(follow up with those who didn't convert and collect testimonials\). The pre-launch phase is where most founders underinvest they spend 90% of their energy on what happens on launch day and almost nothing on the weeks before it.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
