<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2184 0 R
/E (Most founders try to build a viral loop before their product has strong retention. A leaky bucket with a viral loop just leaks faster. Fix retention first  define the moment users get genuine value  then build the loop around that moment. Loops only compound when the core product earns them.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [16]
>>
