3002 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 2190 0 R
/T (The best product in the world fails with the wrong team. The best team in the world fails without clear direction, honest feedback, and the right structure. This module gives you the complete leadership toolkit  from clarifying who owns what, to setting goals that drive real action, to having the honest conversations that most leaders avoid. It includes three Japanese leadership frameworks that bring a depth of discipline most Western management books miss.)
