/S /P
/P 2195 0 R
/E (Your 1-on-1s feel like status updates. You ask how things are going, they tell you, and you both move on. Nothing changes. The conversation is comfortable but not useful. Your best people are not growing and you don't know why.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
