>>
endobj
3157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2195 0 R
/E (The GROW model was developed by Sir John Whitmore and popularised in his 1992 book Coaching for Performance. It is the most widely used coaching framework in the world for a reason: it works. Goal \(what do you want to achieve in this conversation?\), Reality \(what is the current situation honestly?\), Options \(what are all the possible ways forward?\), Will \(what will you specifically commit to doing?\). Applied to 1-on-1s, GROW transforms a status update into a structured coaching conversation that builds capability and accountability.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
