>>
endobj
3358 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2201 0 R
/E (Daniel Coyle's research in The Culture Code identified three core elements of high-performing team cultures: Safety \(people feel they can speak up without risk\), Vulnerability \(leaders show imperfection, creating permission for others to do the same\), and Purpose \(a shared sense of why the work matters\). The Culture Code Canvas operationalises these into a practical document that defines your team's values, behaviours, decision-making norms, and cultural boundaries, the things you hire for, reward, and fire for.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
3359 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 14326 0 R
/E (Write your culture code based on how you actually behave, not how you aspire to behave.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
