3865 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2216 0 R
/E (SIPOC is a Six Sigma process mapping tool that defines a process across five elements: Suppliers \(who provides inputs\), Inputs \(what is needed to start\), Process \(the steps in sequence\), Outputs \(what is produced\), Customers \(who receives the output\). Used as the structure for a Standard Operating Procedure \(SOP\), it ensures every process is fully documented not just the steps, but the context, the handoffs, and the success criteria. AI can generate a first-draft SOP for any process you describe in plain language.)
/Pg 57 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
