/P 2230 0 R
/E (Your team plans a lot but ships inconsistently. Sprints fill up with tasks that don't connect to a clear goal. By the end of two weeks, the sprint goal has shifted or was never clear in the first place.)
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [5]
>>
