/P 2233 0 R
/E (Kaizen's power is not in the size of any single improvement it is in the compound effect and the culture it creates. A team that makes one small improvement per week makes 50 per year. After three years, the cumulative effect of 150 deliberate improvements makes the business unrecognisable from where it started. The math is simple. The discipline is the hard part.)
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [4]
>>
