<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 2240 0 R
/T (Most business failures are not failures of effort  they are failures of decision. The wrong market entered. The wrong hire kept too long. The wrong pivot made too late. This module gives you ten frameworks for structured decision-making  from rapid frameworks for daily decisions to deep analytical tools for irreversible ones. Combined with AI, these frameworks turn gut-feel decisions into evidence-based ones without slowing you down.)
/E (Most business failures are not failures of effort  they are failures of decision. The wrong market entered. The wrong hire kept too long. The wrong pivot made too late. This module gives you ten frameworks for structured decision-making  from rapid frameworks for daily decisions to deep analytical tools for irreversible ones. Combined with AI, these frameworks turn gut-feel decisions into evidence-based ones without slowing you down.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [4]
>>
