4726 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2241 0 R
/E (If you're writing criteria after you've already generated the options, you're not deciding  you're justifying a choice you already made. The order matters as much as the steps: criteria first, or the whole process becomes theater around a decision you'd already reached.)
/Pg 82 0 R
/K [16]
>>
