4740 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2242 0 R
/E (The step most people skip is Establish  defining criteria before looking at options. When you evaluate options without stated criteria, you unconsciously build the criteria around your preferred option. Writing criteria first makes the evaluation honest. If your preferred option scores poorly against honest criteria, that is the most valuable output from this framework.)
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
