5409 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2263 0 R
/E (Payback period is often more important than the LTV:CAC ratio for early-stage companies. A 5:1 LTV:CAC sounds excellent, until you realise the payback period is 36 months and you're burning cash for three years before each customer turns profitable. A 2.5:1 ratio with a 9-month payback is often a healthier business than a 5:1 with a 30-month payback.)
/Pg 104 0 R
/K [4]
>>
