/P 2284 0 R
/E (The Not-To-Do List is as important as the goal list. Every 90-Day Plan assumes you will have capacity you don't currently have. That capacity has to come from somewhere  and the only honest place it can come from is stopping or delegating something you currently do. Write the Not-To-Do List before you commit to the goals.)
