6190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2287 0 R
/E (You manage your calendar carefully but still feel drained and underperforming. You have the time but not the capacity. The problem is not scheduling, it is energy management. You are treating yourself like a machine that runs on hours rather than a human who runs on energy.)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
6191 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2287 0 R
/E (HOW TO USE IT)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
6192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2287 0 R
/E (Jim Loehr and Tony Schwartz, in The Power of Full Engagement, proposed that high performance depends on managing four types of energy: Physical \(the foundation, sleep, movement, nutrition\), Emotional \(stability, resilience, positivity\), Mental \(focus, concentration, clear thinking\), and Spiritual \(meaning, purpose, alignment with values\). Each type of energy has a capacity that can be built through stress and recovery cycles, like a muscle. Most high performers burn energy in all four dimensions without systematically recovering it, leading to diminishing performance over time despite increasing effort.)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
6193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2287 0 R
/E (The mistake most founders make is treating time as the scarce resource and energy as unlimited. It is the opposite. You can always find more hours, but energy that has not been recovered does not come back just because you willed it to. Managing your calendar without managing your energy is optimizing the wrong variable entirely.)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
6194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15208 0 R
/E (Audit your current energy management across all four dimensions before designing any new habits.)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
6195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15209 0 R
/E (Physical energy is foundational, nothing else works well when it is depleted. Fix sleep first.)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
6196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15210 0 R
/E (Identify your highest-energy time of day and protect it for your highest-cognitive work.)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
6197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15211 0 R
/E (Build recovery rituals for each energy type, not just physical recovery.)
/Pg 128 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
